      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im 34 weeks along and urgh my face and hands are like so puffy today its actually kinda crazy lol. and i keep seeing these weird little glimmers or flashes in my eyes like when u blink too hard? i think i might just be super exhausted or maybe just dehydrated... is that like normal for the end of pregnancy?",
